  "fullDescription": "This editable Reading Journal Template is the perfect companion for book lovers, planners, and small business owners!\nDesigned in an aesthetic and minimal style, this 46-page journal can be easily customized in Canva to fit your personal style or brand — or simply printed and used as is.\n\nWhether you’re tracking your monthly reads, setting yearly goals, or reflecting on your favorite books, this journal helps bring structure and joy to your reading life.\nIt’s ideal for personal use or for resale on platforms like Etsy, Amazon KDP, or your own shop.\n\nYou can change fonts, colors, and layout elements to match your audience or preferences — making it a great low-content product for passive income.\n\n📚 *PAGES INCLUDED:\n– cover\n– this journal belongs to\n– my bookshelf\n– my library\n– book review\n– series library\n– series review\n– series book review\n– currently reading\n– book summary (2 variations)\n– 10 book challenge\n– 25 book challenge\n– 50 book challenge\n– 100 book challenge\n– 52 books in 52 weeks\n– 30 day reading challenge\n– reading bingo\n– romance tropes challenge\n– read around the world challenge\n– yearly reading tracker\n– books I’ve read\n– did not finish\n– reading log\n– library tracker\n– genre tracker\n– book lending tracker\n– books borrowed\n– favorite quotes\n– book releases\n– my wishlist (2 variations)\n– books to read\n– favorite authors\n– favorite books\n– book review\n– books to read\n– books to buy\n– monthly reading goals\n– monthly wrap-up\n– yearly reading goals\n– yearly reflection\n– book of the month\n– notes (3 pages)\n\n✅ WHAT’S INCLUDED :\n\n• 1 A ready-to-print PDF file (46 pages) 8.5 in x 11 in\n• An editable Canva template\n\n* All files are zipped in one archive. Before use, you need to unzip the zip file.\nMockups and background images are not included (it’s for presentation purposes only).",
